seasonal space heating energy efficiency for boilers with a rated heat output of more than 20 kW shall not be less than 77 %;
(c)
seasonal space heating emissions of particulate matter shall not be higher than 40 mg/m3 for automatically stoked boilers and not be higher than 60 mg/m3 for manually stoked boilers;
(d)
seasonal space heating emissions of organic gaseous compounds shall not be higher than 20 mg/m3 for automatically stoked boilers and not be higher than 30 mg/m3 for manually stoked boilers;
(e)
seasonal space heating emissions of carbon monoxide shall not be higher than 500 mg/m3 for automatically stoked boilers and not be higher than 700 mg/m3 for manually stoked boilers;
(f)
seasonal space heating emissions of nitrogen oxides, expressed in nitrogen dioxide, shall not be higher than 200 mg/m3 for biomass boilers and not be higher than 350 mg/m3 for fossil fuel boilers;
These requirements shall be met for the preferred fuel and for any other suitable fuel for the solid fuel boiler.
